libopus 1.5.2 (BSD-3-Clause): celt/, silk/, silk/fixed/, decoder parts of src/,
include/ — unmodified; built fixed point, decoder only (Makefile COREB_OPUS_DEFS).
opusfile 0.12 (BSD-3-Clause): opusfile.c, info.c, internal.c. Local change: in a
non-seekable stream the decode buffer is sized for the stream's channel count
instead of 8 (92 KiB less RAM); a later chained link with more channels is
rejected (od_nchannels_max).
libopus: celt/arch.h OPUS_FAST_INT64 may be preset (tests/opusref builds with 0, as core B).
